          "python",
          "=== Hybrid Recommender Dataset ===\nUsers: 40, Items: 25\nTotal ratings: 278\n\nUser history distribution:\n  Warm (action)       : avg 6.8 ratings/user\n  Warm (drama)        : avg 6.5 ratings/user\n  Warm (animation)    : avg 6.2 ratings/user\n  Cold                : avg 1.6 ratings/user\n  Moderate            : avg 4.2 ratings/user"
